LOFI RADIO

Internet audio player for BeitlabOS. It streams a short list of MP3
Icecast/Shoutcast stations through GStreamer and ALSA. It does not take
the LCD, so the dashboard can stay visible.

    lofi start          # first station
    lofi start 3        # station number from `lofi list`
    lofi next
    lofi prev
    lofi status
    lofi stop

Stations live in /etc/lofi-radio/stations as `name|url` lines. Only
direct audio streams work; YouTube and HLS playlists are too heavy for
the T113.
